+From 58dd528a1addc16f8213bc4cfe9307b29f6a4a88 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Kshitij Jalan <kjalan3@illinois.edu>
+Date: Fri, 12 Jun 2026 15:32:08 -0700
+Subject: [PATCH] Fix ghost random talking, misheard questions, and invisible
+ ghost cursor
+
+- Hands-free listener: utterance clock starts at first speech (was 7s total
+  including thinking time), 1.5s trailing-silence confirm, 8s lead-silence
+  give-up, and a Whisper hallucination filter (transcriptFilter.ts) so
+  ambient noise can no longer become phantom user messages.
+- Summon no longer reads the proactive prediction aloud; it shows as a
+  silent bubble and the ghost listens immediately instead.
+- ultraConverse fallback now states honestly that the AI service is
+  unreachable instead of canned 'follow the ghost cursor' non-sequiturs.
+- GhostCursor (OpenUI-themed) now always visible: follows the real pointer
+  beside the mouse when idle, flies to exact targets during walkthroughs.
+- session:walkthrough with zero saved steps surfaces an error instead of
+  silently replaying nothing; demo graph path resolves via app path too.
+
+Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
